  "description": "Curated WHO Global Health Observatory indicators (codes verified live on 2026-11-26 against the GHO OData API) and the WHO area codes the server may request. Only these indicator codes and ISO3 / WHO area codes are ever sent to WHO (G5, G17). Every value shown carries its source and year (G13).",
