  "endpointStatus": "WHO's GHO legacy page (checked 2026-11-26) says this OData API was to be deprecated near the end of 2025 in favour of a 'World Health Data Hub OData API' with standardized field names, but no public URL for the replacement is published yet. The current endpoint is live and serving data updated in October 2026. Re-check at every content review.",
